      "message": "This has caused me to bang my head against the wall for the last 3 hours. I have this CL: https://chromium-review.git.corp.google.com/c/chromium/src/+/8064563?tab\u003dchecks which is failing presubmit because of the formatter but when I do run `git cl format --python` locally and on cider. Nothing happens at all. I deployed AI to investigate this and apparently, there\u0027s some cases where YAPF is used locally / cider but ruff is used in the CI.\n\nThe parent_dir should stop at the chromium root otherwise there\u0027s a chance where the formatter used for CI is different than the one used for local checkout due to some differences outside the root.\n\nNote: PRESUBMIT.py in components/cronet is an ERROR for linter problems and not a warning.",
